    <a class="home-pillar home-pillar--accent" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="160" href="{{ '/papers/' | url }}">
      <span class="home-pillar__number">03</span><span class="home-pillar__tag">READING</span>
      <h2>Paper<br />reader</h2><p>原文、批注与问题并置的论文精读。</p><span class="home-pillar__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
